{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Wy1DJmiHGq1795618344.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國第三季經濟增長終值向上修訂。</p><p></p><p>美國商務部公布，第三季國內生產總值(GDP)按年率計，增長百分之4.3，升幅高過初值和第二季。</p><p></p><p>至於聯儲局用作衡量通脹指標的核心PCE物價指數，第三季升百分之2.5，較第二季低0.8個百分點，但符合市場預測。 </p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T16:25:59.490313+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T14:51:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T10:37:13.981994+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T16:19:11.776135+00:00","content_hash":"7c0663ffd5f57450b85f6789c2209e50bb194eb31d273b2df64c6d94c06c94cc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T16:25:59.490313+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}